{
  "title": "SQL 分組與彙總",
  "subtitle": "SQL GROUP BY",
  "category": "資料庫",
  "summary": "把多筆明細依欄位分組，算出每組的筆數與合計。",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "核心觀念",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "GROUP BY 將相同分類的資料列放進一組，再由 COUNT、SUM 或 AVG 計算組內的彙總值。查詢會為每個分組留下對應的彙總結果。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "操作範例",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "caption": "Sales 範例資料",
          "headers": [
            "category",
            "amount"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "文具",
              120
            ],
            [
              "食品",
              80
            ],
            [
              "文具",
              50
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "text": "SELECT category, COUNT(*) AS row_count, SUM(amount) AS total_amount\nFROM Sales\nGROUP BY category;"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "caption": "查詢結果（列順序可變）",
          "headers": [
            "category",
            "row_count",
            "total_amount"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "文具",
              2,
              170
            ],
            [
              "食品",
              1,
              80
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "使用時機",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "適用於依商品類別彙總銷售額、依班級計算人數等情境。要在分組前篩選明細用 WHERE，要篩選分組結果用 HAVING。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
